        <h3>Call Log Information</h3>
        <p>If you grant the application permission to access call logs, we may collect and process relevant call-related information, such as call history, call type, phone number, date, time, and duration, where permitted by applicable law and platform policies.</p>
        <p>We use this information only for the features and services described within the application, such as maintaining communication records, improving customer service, and supporting relevant CRM or communication functionality.</p>
