        <p>Location information may be used to provide location-based features, improve application functionality, support relevant business operations, and provide services that require location information.</p>
        <p>We only access location information when it is necessary for an enabled feature and permitted by your device settings and applicable law. We do not sell your precise location information to third parties.</p>
