        <p>Contact information may be used to provide features such as selecting contacts, inviting or connecting with users, managing communication records, or other contact-related functionality offered by the application.</p>
        <p>We do not sell your contacts or contact information to third parties. Contact information is processed only for legitimate application functionality and is handled in accordance with applicable privacy and data-protection requirements.</p>
